date":"2026-10-29","zh":"亨廷頓英格斯：改善合約組合，但迫在眉睫的僵局限制了上漲空間（NYSE：HII）"},{"title":"Huntington Ingalls Industries says 10 Romulus unmanned vessels are under construction for U.S. Navy","src":"Defence Industry Europe","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNWnh1bEpYTmV5VXhjWFQ4X1RwY2p4NXpzV0VqVTVuT3N2dmR0NWl4T0E0S19PZjRrYW5OU2UyN3dWWm5TLUxGN2Zad1Y4ZWJkNEpoYkh0a0FOOTJIQWFaUjVSMTZYTGJsNlNKWkw1UjI1Y1dKc0NfUnNUTXphcjRPS3ZkYnRlSTlDZUdPb29tRkJ5WXNZNHVoS0lwZWQzU1lwX2lyMEtSNWNpY1FqSDVtU1NjbnI2aHFoR3hwbF9zczJSVWVENEE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"亨廷頓英格斯工業公司表示，正在為美國海軍建造 10 艘羅穆盧斯無人船"},{"title":"Huntington Ingalls Industries Reports Record Q3 Revenue, Raises Shipbuilding Outlook","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"亨廷頓英格斯工業公司第三季營收創歷史新高，提高造船業前景"},{"title":"[Huntington Ingalls Industries Q3 2026 Earnings Call] HII Lands Record $32.4B in Awards, Backlog Soars to $86.2B as Q3 Sales Hit $3.5B","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE96cWVKS0p2VTN1X0k2cTFSakJ2bkpaYWVhT1J5bUFKUG9nOXB3VTZrVFpTZGotQ2pKd1lBQmxXTEVTcmVSWUpWRG5BOXpGblJuQjNJaldoY2tkdzFo?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[亨廷頓英格斯工業 2026 年第 3 季收益電話會議] HII 獲得創紀錄的 $32.4B 獎項，隨著第三季銷售額達到 $3.5B，積壓訂單飆升至 $86.2B"},{"title":"Huntington Ingalls Industries (HII) Tops Q3 EPS by $1.12, Offers Guidance","src":"StreetInsider","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"亨廷頓英格斯工業公司 (HII) 第三季每股收益成長 1.12 美元，提供指引"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":10},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":3},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-05","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1501585/000150158526000006/hii-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc. (\"HII\", the \"Company\", \"we\", \"us\", or \"our\") is a global, all-domain defense partner, building and delivering the world's most powerful, survivable naval ships and technologies that safeguard America's seas, sky, land, space, and cyber. For more than a century, our Ingalls Shipbuilding segment (\"Ingalls\") in Mississippi and Newport News Shipbuilding segment (\"Newport News\") in Virginia have built more ships in more ship classes than any other U.S. naval shipbuilder, making us America's largest shipbuilder. Our Mission Technologies segment develops integrated technology solutions and products that enable today's connected, all-domain force. Headquartered in Newport News, Virginia, we employ over 44,000 people domestically and internationally.","zh":"亨廷頓英格斯工業公司（「HII」、「公司」、「我們」、「我們」或「我們的」）是一家全球性的全領域國防合作夥伴，致力於建造和提供世界上最強大、生存能力最強的海軍艦艇和技術，以保護美國的海洋、天空、陸地、太空和網路。一個多世紀以來，我們密西西比州的英格斯造船部門（“英格爾斯”）和弗吉尼亞州的紐波特紐斯造船部門（“紐波特紐斯”）建造的船舶數量比任何其他美國海軍造船廠都多，使我們成為美國最大的造船廠。我们的任务技术部门开发集成技术解决方案和产品，以实现当今互联的全域部队。我们的总部位于弗吉尼亚州纽波特纽斯，在国内外拥有超过 44,000 名员工。"},{"en":"We conduct most of our business with the U.S. Government, primarily the Department of War (the \"Department\"). As prime contractor, principal subcontractor, team member, or partner, we participate in many high-priority U.S. defense programs. Ingalls includes our non-nuclear ship design, construction, repair, and maintenance businesses. Newport News includes all of our nuclear ship design, construction, overhaul, refueling, and repair and maintenance businesses. Our Mission Technologies segment provides a wide range of services and products, including command, control, computers, communications, cyber, intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance (\"C5ISR\") systems and operations; the application of artificial intelligence and machine learning to battlefield decisions; defense and offensive cyberspace strategies and electronic warfare; unmanned autonomous systems; live, virtual, and const","zh":"我們的大部分業務都是與美國政府（主要是陸軍部）進行的。作为主承包商、主要分包商、团队成员或合作伙伴，我们参与了许多高度优先的美国国防项目。英格斯包括我們的非核能船舶設計、建造、修理和維護業務。纽波特纽斯包括我们所有的核船舶设计、建造、大修、加油以及维修和保养业务。我們的任務技術部門提供廣泛的服務和產品，包括指揮、控制、電腦、通訊、網路、情報、監視和偵察（「C5ISR」）系統和操作；人工智慧和機器學習在戰場決策中的應用；防禦和進攻性網路空間戰略和電子戰；無人自主系統；即時、虛擬和常量"},{"en":"Through our Ingalls segment, we design and construct non-nuclear ships for the U.S. Navy and U.S. Coast Guard, including amphibious assault ships, surface combatants, and national security cutters (\"NSC\"). We are the sole builder of amphibious assault ships and one of two builders of surface combatants for the U.S. Navy. Our Ingalls segment is located in Pascagoula, Mississippi on 800 acres along the Pascagoula River.","zh":"透過我們的英格斯部門，我們為美國海軍和美國海岸防衛隊設計和建造非核艦艇，包括兩棲攻擊艦、水面戰鬥艦和國家安全巡邏艦（「NSC」）。我们是唯一的两栖攻击舰建造商，也是美国海军的两家水面战舰建造商之一。我们的英格尔斯分部位于密西西比州帕斯卡古拉，位于帕斯卡古拉河沿岸，占地 800 英亩。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our revenues are primarily derived from the U.S. Government, including the U.S. Navy, the U.S. Coast Guard, the Department, the DoE, and other federal agencies. In 2025, 2024, and 2023, approximately 81%, 80%, and 81%, respectively, of our revenues were generated from the U.S. Navy.","zh":""},{"en":"We develop new technologies, manufacturing processes, and systems-integration processes. In addition to owning our intellectual property, we license intellectual property rights to and from third parties. The U.S. Government generally receives license rights to certain intellectual property developed in the performance of U.S. Government contracts or with government funding and may use or authorize other parties to use such intellectual property. While our intellectual property rights are important to our operations, we do not believe that any existing patent, license, or other intellectual property right is of such importance that its loss or termination would have a material adverse impact on our business. See Risk Factors in Item 1A for further discussion regarding risks related to intellectual property.","zh":"我们开发新技术、制造工艺和系统集成工艺。除了拥有我们的知识产权之外，我们还向第三方许可知识产权。美國政府通常會獲得在履行美國政府合約或政府資助下開發的某些智慧財產權的許可權，並且可以使用或授權其他方使用此類智慧財產權。雖然我們的智慧財產權對我們的營運很重要，但我們認為任何現有的專利、授權或其他智慧財產權的重要性都不會高到其遺失或終止會對我們的業務產生重大不利影響。有关知识产权相关风险的进一步讨论，请参阅第 1A 项中的风险因素。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a competitive environment and compete with defense companies and other companies serving the intelligence and federal civil markets.","zh":""},{"en":"Our Newport News and Ingalls segments compete primarily with General Dynamics and, in the case of certain non-nuclear shipbuilding programs, smaller shipyards. Intense competition related to programs, resources, funding, and long operating cycles are key characteristics of both our shipbuilding business and the shipbuilding defense industry in general.","zh":"我們的紐波特紐斯和英格斯部門主要與通用動力公司競爭，就某些非核子造船項目而言，與較小的造船廠競爭。与项目、资源、资金和长运营周期相关的激烈竞争是我们造船业务和整个造船国防工业的关键特征。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Newport News Shipbuilding","val":6507000000,"zh":"紐波特紐斯造船廠"},{"name":"Ingalls","val":3078000000,"zh":"英格爾斯"},{"name":"Mission Technologies","val":3044000000,"zh":"使命技術"}],"total":12484000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":8133000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":4351000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":12484000000}},"peers":["LHX","LDOS","NOC","TDG","GD"]}}